{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50660","headline":"劝酒行 · 鲍溶","name":"劝酒行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乐往难重得，老来岂自由。\n婵娟过三五，珠翠成仇雠。\n君不闻古曲，酒能消人忧。\n何人更年少，君惜秉烛游。\n莫闲金丝手，月在西南楼。\n罗换歌妾袂，锦缠舞人头。\n半醉月入怀，仰空笑牵牛。\n那令酒生尘，虚见红貌秋。\n（见《永乐大典》卷一二○四三「二十有」「酒」字「劝酒」条〖十三函一百二十四册〗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50660.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50660","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}